        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Nice area with some useful/essential spots based on your needs like the pharmacy, bank and pet store. The parking lot could be organized a bit better with larger lanes but overall it's easy to get around. There's a sidewalk along the entire building making it easy to get around on foot.",
        "time": 1656417055,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Regman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100277037905362502930/reviews",
